Ensure:

Real-time encrypted synchronization.
Per-device encryption sessions.
Perfect Forward Secrecy.
Post-Quantum Cryptography support.
Secure device onboarding.
Secure device revocation.
Automatic session recovery after reconnecting.
Protection against replay and impersonation attacks.
